id: pmc-milestone-status-roles
title: Use configured done status roles for immutable milestone generation
description: Milestone generation previously selected literal closed rows while correction reads honored configured terminal_done roles. PR #291 now shares one SDK-registry-based first-publication ledger across generation and corrections. This item retains the original follow-up and its regression evidence.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
